<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2998_11801.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich willig dienst, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> wir ehren,
<lb n="2"/>liebs <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegend</unclear> zuovor, fromm, fürsichtig,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrsam</unclear>, wyß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innsonnders</unclear> guot <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründ</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> getrüw lieb
<lb n="4"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgenoßen</unclear></orgName>.
